configs/omarchy-smc.config: build macsmc-power in, gated by initcall_blacklist

Requires patches/linux/0011 (macsmc-power work-init race fix). Boot with
initcall_blacklist=macsmc_power_driver_init until TEST-PLAN T6 passes.

Apply in the omarchy-m5 checkout: git apply <this file>

diff --git a/configs/omarchy-smc.config b/configs/omarchy-smc.config
--- a/configs/omarchy-smc.config
+++ b/configs/omarchy-smc.config
@@ -17,7 +17,14 @@
 CONFIG_INPUT_MACSMC_INPUT=y
 CONFIG_GPIO_MACSMC=y
 CONFIG_SENSORS_MACSMC_HWMON=y
-# CONFIG_MACSMC_POWER (battery) is not built in: it panicked the M5 at boot
-# (2026-10-02, cause not yet read off the panel). Off until diagnosed.
+#
+# Battery/charger is built in again, gated per boot: it panicked the M5 at
+# boot once (2026-10-02, panel not read). The kernel carries the macsmc-power
+# work-init race fix (patches/linux/0011); until the TEST-PLAN battery step
+# (T6) has passed, boot with
+#   initcall_blacklist=macsmc_power_driver_init
+# which keeps the driver from registering at all (everything else in this
+# fragment is unaffected). Drop the argument to test it.
+CONFIG_MACSMC_POWER=y
 CONFIG_SPMI_APPLE=y
 CONFIG_NVMEM_APPLE_SPMI=y
